  m_Name: Lobby_ElevatorRide
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  sequenceId: Lobby_ElevatorRide
  notes: 'Elevator briefing before arrival on floor 17. Source: HEARTH_Full_Game_Script_No_Audio_Tags_Native_English.md,
    stable marker Lobby_ElevatorRide. Text is synchronized by Tools/Hearth/Dialogue/Sync
    All Dialogue From Final Script. Playback policy HEARTH_V2_DIALOGUE_POLICY_2026_08_01.'
  dialogueChannel: 0
  defaultSpeakerSide: 0
  advancePolicy: 0
  lines:
  - lineId: Lobby_ElevatorRide_FieldUnit_001
    presentationKind: 0
    dialogueMode: 0
    speakerSide: 0
    advancePolicy: 0
    startDelay: 0.15
    speaker: Field Unit
    text: Inspector, before we reach seventeen, I'll give you a brief overview. Procedure
      first, then I'll guide you into the route.
    holdSeconds: 8.697169
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 563a0fadc7f814749982204f97fd0c2e, type: 3}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - lineId: Lobby_ElevatorRide_Mia_001
    presentationKind: 2
    dialogueMode: 0
    speakerSide: 0
    advancePolicy: 2
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Mia
    text: Go ahead.
    holdSeconds: 2.2
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 55b39e39f490ab34793a7194cd9ab25c, type: 3}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - lineId: Lobby_ElevatorRide_FieldUnit_002
    presentationKind: 0
    dialogueMode: 0
    speakerSide: 0
    advancePolicy: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Field Unit
    text: Every inspection has three steps. First, read the household file at the
      corridor terminal.
    holdSeconds: 6.4330187
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c8746da604dcd934a813d079247cdff3, type: 3}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - lineId: Lobby_ElevatorRide_FieldUnit_003
    presentationKind: 0
    dialogueMode: 0
    speakerSide: 0
    advancePolicy: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Field Unit
    text: Second, enter the household unit's point of view and replay the event under
      review.
    holdSeconds: 6.4330187
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 66e84715081227847a470a21a6da42fb, type: 3}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - lineId: Lobby_ElevatorRide_FieldUnit_004
    presentationKind: 0
    dialogueMode: 0
    speakerSide: 0
    advancePolicy: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Field Unit
    text: Third, select a disposition. Your decision changes how the unit is used
      and may affect the Household Emotional Stability Index.
    holdSeconds: 8.697169
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d40ea315481b30c47814da8c5988f5ed, type: 3}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - lineId: Lobby_ElevatorRide_Mia_002
    presentationKind: 2
    dialogueMode: 0
    speakerSide: 0
    advancePolicy: 2
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Mia
    text: And you'll tell me which one you'd pick.
    holdSeconds: 4.1688676
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 46bbe71e05273d3478aed6a11ffa9430, type: 3}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - lineId: Lobby_ElevatorRide_FieldUnit_005
    presentationKind: 0
    dialogueMode: 0
    speakerSide: 0
    advancePolicy: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Field Unit
    text: "Of course. Every recommendation comes straight from the manual\u2014the
      company line."
    holdSeconds: 5.3009434
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 1ae881c21b88ef149a00abef5cffa4d8, type: 3}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - lineId: Lobby_ElevatorRide_Mia_003
    presentationKind: 2
    dialogueMode: 0
    speakerSide: 0
    advancePolicy: 2
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Mia
    text: Understood. I'll still make my own call.
    holdSeconds: 3.7915094
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 9ad1e87899f3e4e4aac3618c9e32d8ae, type: 3}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  postSequenceDelay: 0.18
